  "C|第2、3集通过后转正：**Inner voice runs over action and stays short (TR-V09).** In conflict or fight shots the inner-voice line plays while the action continues; nobody stands still to \"listen\" to it, and a long line may be shortened to the novel's meaning (change dialogue, `<d>` and sub_shots together).": "C-002",
  "C|**Inner-voice (OS) shots follow the Inner-Monologue section above (handbook M33/M34; rewritten 2026-11-23).** Write the natural-close sentence at the start and `his lips stay naturally together` in the last hold sentence; the face reacts only with the eyes, brows, head and shoulders. Never add mouth or breath wording such as `lips remain completely closed`, `does not mouth the words` or `breath` — negated mouth words are errors too (M33 L647).": "C-003",
  "C|C-009【待测】每个心声窗口写明起止秒（续轮6 补，总导 20:33 心声门禁）": "C-004",
  "D|第2、3集通过后转正：**System UI: short text on the panel; the system's full spoken line goes in `<d>` and H3 speaks it (TR-V04; system voice per Andy 11-23 17:27 本人选择卡原话「按14:55，系统声音在提示词里念完整内容」, which overrides the 16:04 line 「系统声音还是按照原来设计去作业」; panel text per Andy 11-23 14:55 选择卡（总导转述）and 总导 11-23 15:09 / 15:17 裁定; narration 旁白 is unchanged and stays in post).**": "D-001",
